    "detailed_description": "Explore the exciting world of football in a new format with Flipper Soccer - an electrifying game that combines the classic pinball game with the intense action of the world's most popular sport. Play in a quick and thrilling match against a carefully chosen opponent - whether a close friend or the computer itself - and use your quick reflexes and strategic skills to control the flippers and score goals. With beautiful graphics and immersive sound effects, Flipper Soccer offers a unique and exciting experience for football and pinball lovers.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Five different stages.<br></li><li>Three different balls.<br></li><li>Online multiplayer mode.<br></li><li>Local multiplayer mode.<br></li><li>Steam achievements.</li></ul>",
